  class=pskg:BusinessRule
  identity={"pskg:businessRuleCondition": "The credit limit is determined by the bank based on a comprehensive credit assessment. Factors that may be considered include: Monthly income, Employment stability, Length of employment, Credit history, Current outstanding debt, Limits and outstanding balances on other credit cards, Monthly debt obligations, Existing relationship with the bank, Ability to provide evidence of income, Credit risk assessment results."}
